# This repo only

`origin` is **antgraf/hearth-speed-dial**. This project has no upstream.

The older speed-dial repos are out of bounds:

- `conceptualspace/yet-another-speed-dial`
- `antgraf/yet-another-speed-dial-2`

## Hard rules

- Do not create, update, comment on, or close PRs on those repos.
- Do not push to them, and do not add either as a git remote.
- Create PRs only here:

```powershell
gh pr create --repo antgraf/hearth-speed-dial --base main --head <branch> ...
```

- After `gh pr create`, verify the URL is `github.com/antgraf/hearth-speed-dial/pull/...`.
- Do not rely on bare `gh pr create` or `gh repo view`. Pass `--repo antgraf/hearth-speed-dial`.
- Push with `git push -u origin HEAD`.

## Why

On a previous clone, `gh` treated an unrelated parent repo as the default PR base and opened pull requests there. This repo must not inherit that default.
